{"team":"TEN","col":"#4FC3E8","identity":"run-heavy","funnel":"run-funnel","plays_pg":59.6,"adot":7.6,"report_html":"<div class=\"report\"><h2>Bleed the Clock</h2><p>The backfield runs through one man \u2014 <strong>Tony Pollard</strong> absorbs <strong>70% of the carries</strong> (league ~59%), a true bell-cow share that makes his rushing volume among the safest floors in the sport when the script cooperates.</p><h3>The Offensive Blueprint</h3><p>Few offenses are as committed to the run as TEN. Their pass rate over expected sits at <strong>-5%</strong> \u2014 well below the -2% norm \u2014 and it collapses to 38% once they're in front. The script writes itself: build a lead, then bludgeon.</p><p>When they fall behind they abandon the run entirely \u2014 62% pass while trailing, so their pass-catchers have huge comeback-script ceilings.</p><p>By the numbers it's a struggling unit \u2014 a 39% success rate (below the 44% average).</p><h3>In the Red Zone</h3><p>Their red-zone identity is <strong>pass-first</strong> (54% pass), which puts scoring equity on <strong>Wan'Dale Robinson</strong>.</p><h2>Defense \u2014 Soft on the Ground</h2><p>They surrender <strong>125 rushing</strong> and <strong>219 passing</strong> yards per game (league ~120 / ~230). The run moves against them \u2014 <strong>target opposing RB1s</strong>.</p><p><strong>Soft against opposing WR2s</strong> \u2014 44 rec yds/game (vs ~36). A rec-yards target.</p><p>They leak <strong>WR1 receiving TDs</strong> (0.53/game vs ~0.38) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><p>They lock down backs out of the backfield \u2014 just 13 rec yds/game (vs ~18); fade receiving props there.</p><p>They leak <strong>RB rushing TDs</strong> (0.53/game vs ~0.46) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><h2>The Betting Angles</h2><p>Bottom line: back <strong>Tony Pollard</strong>'s rushing volume in favored/positive scripts; their pass-catchers have massive ceilings in comeback scripts (fade-material as underdogs); <strong>opposing RB1s</strong> smash on the ground and at the goal line.</p><p><em>Built on 2024\u201325 data; the profile rebuilds through the season as the current staff and roster set their own tendencies.</em></p></div>","depth":{"QB":[{"name":"Cam Ward","slot":"QB1","starter":true,"td":11,"props":{"Comp":16.13,"Att":26.79,"Pass Yds":160.3,"Pass TD":0.81,"INT":0.34,"Rush Yds":12.02}}],"RB":[{"name":"Tony Pollard","slot":"RB1","starter":true,"td":29,"props":{"Rush Att":13.75,"Rush Yds":62.71,"Tgt":2.11,"Rec":1.68,"Rec Yds":11.53}},{"name":"Tyjae Spears","slot":"RB2","starter":true,"td":21,"props":{"Rush Att":3.57,"Rush Yds":14.77,"Tgt":3.53,"Rec":2.46,"Rec Yds":16.69}},{"name":"Nicholas Singleton","slot":"RB3","starter":false,"td":15,"props":{"Rush Att":2.64,"Rush Yds":11.1,"Tgt":1.14,"Rec":0.78,"Rec Yds":5.56}},{"name":"Julius Chestnut","slot":"RB4","starter":false,"td":9,"props":{"Rush Att":1.95,"Rush Yds":7.21,"Tgt":1.27,"Rec":0.81,"Rec Yds":6.38}}],"WR":[{"name":"Carnell Tate","slot":"WR1","starter":true,"td":21,"props":{"Tgt":5.04,"Rec":3.29,"Rec Yds":40.79,"Rec TD":0.24}},{"name":"Wan'Dale Robinson","slot":"WR2","starter":true,"td":20,"props":{"Tgt":7.54,"Rec":5.21,"Rec Yds":49.1,"Rec TD":0.22}},{"name":"Calvin Ridley","slot":"WR3","starter":true,"td":15,"props":{"Tgt":3.86,"Rec":1.85,"Rec Yds":25.29,"Rec TD":0.16}},{"name":"Chimere Dike","slot":"WR4","starter":false,"td":18,"props":{"Tgt":4.54,"Rec":2.48,"Rec Yds":24.29,"Rec TD":0.21}},{"name":"Elic Ayomanor","slot":"WR5","starter":false,"td":17,"props":{"Tgt":4.92,"Rec":2.53,"Rec Yds":31.89,"Rec TD":0.19}}],"TE":[{"name":"Gunnar Helm","slot":"TE1","starter":true,"td":14,"props":{"Tgt":3.4,"Rec":2.61,"Rec Yds":22.85,"Rec TD":0.15}},{"name":"Daniel Bellinger","slot":"TE2","starter":false,"td":12,"props":{"Tgt":2.83,"Rec":1.92,"Rec Yds":19.29,"Rec TD":0.12}},{"name":"Kylen Granson","slot":"TE3","starter":false,"td":6,"props":{"Tgt":2.73,"Rec":1.5,"Rec Yds":15.88,"Rec TD":0.06}}]},"schedule":[{"week":1,"ha":"vs","opp